div.p:
                        Hello,




                        A purchase requisition ${object.name} requires your attention.




                        Details:



                                Requested By:
                                ${object.user_id.name}



                                Department:
                                ${object.department_id.name}



                                Request Date:
                                ${format_date(object.date_request)}



                                Required Date:
                                ${format_date(object.date_required)}



                                Estimated Amount:
                                ${object.estimated_amount} ${object.currency_id.symbol}



                                Priority:
                                ${dict(object._fields['priority'].selection).get(object.priority)}




                        Items Requested:

                            % for line in object.line_ids:

${line.product_id.name} - Qty: ${line.quantity} ${line.uom_id.name}
                            % endfor



                        % if object.description:
                        Description:


                        ${object.description}




                        % endif



                                View Requisition




                        Thank you,


                        ${object.user_id.name}

Hello ${object.user_id.name},




Your purchase requisition ${object.name} has been approved.




Approval Details:



        Approved By:
        ${object.approved_by_id.name}



        Approval Date:
        ${format_datetime(object.date_approved)}



        Estimated Amount:
        ${object.estimated_amount} ${object.currency_id.symbol}




The requisition will now proceed to purchase order creation.







        View Requisition




Best regards,


${object.approved_by_id.name}
